    <div style="background:#13233a;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:20px;border:1px solid #24415f;">
    <h3 style="color:#7dd3fc;margin-top:0;">7. Worked Examples</h3>
    <p>The examples get harder as you go. Cover the solution, try the problem, then compare.</p>
    <div style="background:#0b1729;border-left:4px solid #22c55e;border-radius:9px;padding:16px;margin:16px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#86efac;font-weight:bold;">✏️ Worked Example 1: Missing terms <span style="font-size:12px;color:#0b1220;background:#86efac;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;margin-left:6px;">Easy</span>
    </p>
    <p style="margin:4px 0;"><strong style="color:#fde68a;">Problem:</strong> Find the missing terms: 8, 15, __, 29, __.</p>
    <p style="margin:8px 0;color:#cbd5e1;font-style:italic;">🧠 <strong>Thinking process:</strong> Gap is 7.</p>
    <div style="background:#13233a;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin:8px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;min-width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;color:#0b1220;font-weight:bold;margin-right:8px;">1</span><strong style="color:#bae6fd;">Step 1:</strong> 15 − 8 = 7</p>
    <p style="margin:6px 0 0 34px;color:#cbd5e1;"><em>Explanation:</em> Common difference.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#13233a;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin:8px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;min-width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;color:#0b1220;font-weight:bold;margin-right:8px;">2</span><strong style="color:#bae6fd;">Step 2:</strong> 15 + 7 = 22</p>
    <p style="margin:6px 0 0 34px;color:#cbd5e1;"><em>Explanation:</em> Third term.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#13233a;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin:8px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;min-width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;color:#0b1220;font-weight:bold;margin-right:8px;">3</span><strong style="color:#bae6fd;">Step 3:</strong> 29 + 7 = 36</p>
    <p style="margin:6px 0 0 34px;color:#cbd5e1;"><em>Explanation:</em> Fifth term.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#052e16;border:1px solid #22c55e;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin-top:10px;"><strong style="color:#86efac;">✅ Final answer:</strong> 22, 36</div>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#0b1729;border-left:4px solid #22c55e;border-radius:9px;padding:16px;margin:16px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#86efac;font-weight:bold;">✏️ Worked Example 2: Multiplying sequence <span style="font-size:12px;color:#0b1220;background:#fde68a;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;margin-left:6px;">Medium</span>
    </p>
    <p style="margin:4px 0;"><strong style="color:#fde68a;">Problem:</strong> Find the next two terms: 2, 6, 18, 54, …</p>
    <p style="margin:8px 0;color:#cbd5e1;font-style:italic;">🧠 <strong>Thinking process:</strong> Gaps are not equal; try dividing.</p>
    <div style="background:#13233a;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin:8px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;min-width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;color:#0b1220;font-weight:bold;margin-right:8px;">1</span><strong style="color:#bae6fd;">Step 1:</strong> 6 ÷ 2 = 3; 18 ÷ 6 = 3</p>
    <p style="margin:6px 0 0 34px;color:#cbd5e1;"><em>Explanation:</em> Multiply by 3.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#13233a;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin:8px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;min-width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;color:#0b1220;font-weight:bold;margin-right:8px;">2</span><strong style="color:#bae6fd;">Step 2:</strong> 54 × 3 = 162; 162 × 3 = 486</p>
    <p style="margin:6px 0 0 34px;color:#cbd5e1;"><em>Explanation:</em> Next terms.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#052e16;border:1px solid #22c55e;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin-top:10px;"><strong style="color:#86efac;">✅ Final answer:</strong> 162, 486</div>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#0b1729;border-left:4px solid #22c55e;border-radius:9px;padding:16px;margin:16px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#86efac;font-weight:bold;">✏️ Worked Example 3: Far term <span style="font-size:12px;color:#0b1220;background:#fb923c;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;margin-left:6px;">Hard</span>
    </p>
    <p style="margin:4px 0;"><strong style="color:#fde68a;">Problem:</strong> A savings group saves Ksh 200 in week 1, Ksh 350 in week 2, Ksh 500 in week 3, …. How much is saved in week 20?</p>
    <p style="margin:8px 0;color:#cbd5e1;font-style:italic;">🧠 <strong>Thinking process:</strong> First 200, difference 150.</p>
    <div style="background:#13233a;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin:8px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;min-width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;color:#0b1220;font-weight:bold;margin-right:8px;">1</span><strong style="color:#bae6fd;">Step 1:</strong> 200 + (20 − 1) × 150</p>
    <p style="margin:6px 0 0 34px;color:#cbd5e1;"><em>Explanation:</em> Use the n-th term formula.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#13233a;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin:8px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;min-width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;color:#0b1220;font-weight:bold;margin-right:8px;">2</span><strong style="color:#bae6fd;">Step 2:</strong> 200 + 2 850</p>
    <p style="margin:6px 0 0 34px;color:#cbd5e1;"><em>Explanation:</em> 19 × 150 = 2 850.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#13233a;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin:8px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;min-width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;color:#0b1220;font-weight:bold;margin-right:8px;">3</span><strong style="color:#bae6fd;">Step 3:</strong> = 3 050</p>
    <p style="margin:6px 0 0 34px;color:#cbd5e1;"><em>Explanation:</em> Week 20 saving.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#052e16;border:1px solid #22c55e;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin-top:10px;"><strong style="color:#86efac;">✅ Final answer:</strong> Ksh 3 050</div>
    </div>
    </div>
