    <div style="background:#0b1729;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;margin-top:6px;color:#e0f2fe;">(a) 72 = 2³ × 3², 120 = 2³ × 3 × 5 [1]; GCD = 2³ × 3 = 24 [1]; LCM = 2³ × 3² × 5 = 360 [1]. (b) 24 × 360 = 8 640 = 72 × 120 [2].</div>
